Use Rotation of Marker [check box]
To make the AGV use the rotation of the Marker on its way to its destination, select this check box.
Remarks
Select the check box, to make the AGV drive across the Marker and rotate on the Marker with the defined
angle in the direction of the next Marker. The graphic of a directional marker, which you inserted into the
Frame, looks like this 
 .
For the default angle of 0° it looks like this:
If you type in a rotation angle, for example 90°, it looks like this:
You can set the rotation angle in the dialog Edit 3D Properties of the Marker on the tab Transformation
under Settings for the Rotation.
